"""Mutations of src/game/seat_weapon.cpp's part 3b (the turret, the controls, firing, reloading, aiming)
for ../mutfast.py with the seat weapon build:

    python mutfast.py mutations/mutate_seat_weapon_3b.py --models DIR --build build_sw.bat --check check_sw.py

Each should make check_sw.py fail (or the harness crash). (The recoil's impulse has no effect, at the
lever origin with no push: its factors are not mutated. Dropped as equivalent: WrapAngle's "> TWO_PI"
case (its angles are atan2's, or the difference of two wrapped ones, never above 2 pi) and
LocalDirYZX's normalisation (TurnByControls only takes atan2 ratios of the direction and normalises
it again before SetWorldDir).)"""
